    "summary": "Portrait of a young man; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young man in a full-length pink robe worn over a yellow flowered dress, white pantaloons and undershirt, stands holding an orange fruit and a standard in the shape of the name ʿAli. He wears a conical shaped hat inscribed with cartouches containing the words: &quot;Ya Ahad Ya Samad&quot;. A purse with two ducks&#039; heads is draped over the youth&#039;s arm. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
